{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-01_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-01","title":"昨日，穀殼將裂","storyCode":"R8-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a81d7aeb9bc482b187930d77cbe8f27d9b5e8d9cca18dad9817f6e5d4d58835f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenbri"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_top"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你終於來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"暉潔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"暉潔：\n連日大雪，雪層封住了整片山谷。\n樹莓叢還沒抽芽，春天簡直像是永遠不會來。\n我們被困在這裡，缺吃少穿，等著雪化的每個日子都安靜得讓人發瘋。\n不如說，我覺得事情有些古怪。\n我們一路上就沒順利過，再好的情形被我碰上都會迅速惡化。\n可能真像龍門人說的那樣，我就是個災星，在我身邊就不會發生什麼好事。\n這讓我想起好幾年前的一些事情。\n我想，我還是要和你說說，否則我心裡是沒法安穩的。\n12月14日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"narration","text":"脫離黑蛇第三年\n烏薩斯小村莊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，快回來！別讓他們看見你這身衣服啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，別念了！我這就進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是不肯換掉你這身衣服！都說了多少遍了，這衣服會把蟲子招惹來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"大隻的黑蟲，還有毒......一口咬下去，就連田地都不會長莊稼啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我平常不也是好好穿著普通衣服的嗎？這兩天只是因為有事要出門才換上這身衣服的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你想，奶奶，送我這身衣服的那個老爺，年輕帥氣的老爺，我是要穿著這身衣服，他才能記住我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我是相信命運會送他與我重逢的，到時候，爺爺和奶奶就都能過上好日子啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，塔露拉......塔露拉！你這個謊話精，上次你哪是這麼說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我是怎麼說的？我也忘記了，不就是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你上次還說這身衣服是你爸爸送給你做生日禮物的呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"說你爸爸在街上被什麼頭上頂個環的外國人搶劫了，你哭著穿著這身衣服逃了出來，衣服上沾滿了你爸爸的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"這都什麼和什麼......再上次你說的又不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這次我不是這麼說的？奶奶的記性可真好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你誇我也沒用！淨胡說些有的沒的......我已經快進棺材啦，你每次欺騙我這樣一個老傢伙，難道不會感到羞恥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對不起，奶奶，我錯了，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊坐下！別換衣服了，整天瞎搞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"快快！把午飯給吃了。說了要中午回來，現在太陽都快跌進山裡去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"湯我還給你熱著，都快燒乾了，再這樣下去，你直接吃晚飯好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下在上，我們這丫頭怎麼是這個樣子啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊吃完，老頭子找你還有事。這個死醉鬼！又跑哪裡去了......你得自己去找他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，我知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，姑娘家長得這麼好，嘴巴卻一點也不實在！和城裡那些個甜言蜜語的小子可真像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶我年輕時候也是差點被騙去......都不是好東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"別念了......這我也聽過好多次了啊，奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你還說！喏......快接。哎呀，快拿住盤子！把麵包也趕緊吃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"也別這麼急！噎著了該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎，但是你來那天滿身是血，那是真的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在想想還有點害怕呢，塔露拉，要不是你是這麼一個好孩子，老頭子一定就用斧頭把你劈死在門外頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有能一眼看出來別人是不是好人的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑到這裡那天，又是個黑乎乎的晚上，外頭又有野獸，不管是馱獸還是肉獸，可都是叫個不停！讓我好緊張啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，還有你手上拿的那把......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，噗......咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那可真是好大一把刀！我這輩子都沒見過這麼大的刀啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那是把劍......是劍！不是刀。別再拿這把劍上山開路了，又不好用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，奶奶！不是說好不准提這件事嗎？我可要生氣了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你看我這張嘴，呸，皇帝在上！不說了，下次絕對不會再說了！陛下啊，原諒我這老不死一時無心的過錯吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣，奶奶，皇帝可沒空管這個。他在他的大城市裡可是過得好得很呢，我們呢，連下個星期吃的馬鈴薯都沒地方找。他想管也管不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，現在是哪位皇帝，恐怕奶奶都不清楚吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"淨瞎說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這湯......家裡沒鹽了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"沒啦！......早就沒啦。昨晚鹽罐子就空了！嘿，你們祖孫倆敗家子！吃那麼多鹽......遲早把你們鹹死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"每次出去一兩天，也不知道在做啥！回來以後啥也沒帶，錢也沒有，糧食也沒有！敗家娘們兒......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，行了，我去換點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"身體那麼好，多幹點活兒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"別去換了，我剛剛和阿麗娜說了，她會給我們家拿點。你再看看你這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"人家姑娘可比你安穩多了，又喜歡讀書，手工也勤快，你到現在連衣服都不會自己縫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......人各有志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人都有自己的志向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的志向是啥啊？早點找個好人家，帶個結實的小夥子小英雌回來吧！指望你幹活，苔麥都要爛在地裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"年年農活我可都沒缺席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"這才幾年！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"老媽媽，塔露拉幹起活來可是一點都不落後的。你別再說她啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"阿麗娜！你可得幫忙說說她，再讓她這麼下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"也不會出什麼事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你總算來了。也就你能讓奶奶安靜一小會兒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"真是翅膀硬了！披著一身不知哪弄來的制服，就覺得自己是個貴族樣子了？身子骨還沒多壯實，架子就先擺了起來，從哪學來的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我去幹活了！你們自己吃吧。阿麗娜要是餓了就也吃些。塔露拉，別吃太多！給阿麗娜留些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不用啦，老媽媽。謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，我拿了鹽過來。鹽販下個星期就會再來，到時候記得買些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"真是很感激你，阿麗娜。沒你，奶奶還得再念個二十分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我可聽著呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你這回又去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，只是出去走了走，採採風。喏，你要的風景畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你居然還記得。真的很感謝你，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"這個筆觸......這不是附近的畫工畫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"什米爾村的老畫師只會用硬刷，他根本想不到用羽毛刷。這麼軟的末梢，這是夜眼的尾毛......脫皮以前的尾毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你去了城裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞞不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"瞞我做什麼呢？我不是憲兵，也不是稅吏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要知道那些很危險的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就是身處危險之中了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"面前的鹿就像隻精怪。白髮的德拉克深切地感受到，如果不想讓事情被阿麗娜知道，最好的方法就是讓那些事情別發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我說......阿麗娜，你也不用管那麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不好了！不好了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事兒慌慌張張的！門都不敲就衝進來！把門閂撞壞了可怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感......感染者糾察隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏薩斯農民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子和人鬧起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"啥？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！你去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，刀！阿麗娜，別讓她拿那東西！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"再說一遍，老頭，我現在把你腿打斷，也一樣能進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"上次已經搜過了，現在又來幹什麼！現在連稅都交不起了，你還要訛我們多少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"這是例行檢查！這回可不管你給不給好處，每兩年都必做一次的檢查......這個不幹的話，連我們都要一起吃鞭子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，要是你們肯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都給不了了，已經什麼都給不了了！我們沒錢，沒有首飾，連糧食也沒有了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那還廢話什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"例行檢查！快點讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，老爺！官員老爺，我們真的沒什麼東西能給了！如果真要拿走些啥，你就把我這條老命拿去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫你讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我的腿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哪裡來的小妞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——喂。你這身衣服，從哪來的？農民可穿不起這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的是，你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不准再靠近了！你想做什麼？你的眼神......哈，多可怕的眼神啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——你想死嗎！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]}]}
